# Only for development (`npm run dev:web`, tests). The desktop app ignores these: there, the
# provider, model and feedback export folder are set in Settings, and the API key is kept in the
# macOS Keychain or Windows Credential Manager.
#
# "claude-code" uses your local Claude Code login (Claude subscription, personal use);
# "claude" uses the Claude API (needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY); "fake" gives deterministic replies.
AI_PROVIDER=fake
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the model (default claude-opus-5).
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# Where feedback screenshots and the generated FEEDBACK.md live for dev:web (default: feedback/).
# FEEDBACK_DIR=feedback
